l,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"12 000 BHK — 440 000 so'mlik BHKda 5 280 000 000 so'm. Soliq davri uchun daromad bu summadan oshganda QQS to'lovchisi sifatida ro'yxatdan o'tish majburiy."}]}]]}],["$","$L23","5",{"value":"faq-5","children":[["$","$L24",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"BHK qachon va kim tomonidan tasdiqlanadi?"}],["$","$L25",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"BHK (bazaviy hisoblash kattaligi) Prezident Farmoni bilan belgilanadi. Odatda yiliga bir marta avgust-sentabr oylarida indeksatsiya qilinadi. Joriy holat: 2026-yil 1-sentabridan 440 000 so'm (PF-115 Farmoni); bundan oldin 412 000 so'm edi."}]}]]}],["$","$L23","6",{"value":"faq-6","children":[["$","$L24",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"BHK va minimal ish haqi bir xilmi?"}],["$","$L25",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Yo'q, bu ikki turli ko'rsatkich. BHK — soliq, jarima, davlat boji va imtiyozlarni hisoblash uchun. Minimal ish haqi — eng past oylik ish haqi standarti. Ular alohida belgilanadi."}]}]]}]]}]]}]
